#: ../../source/docs/common-speedybeef4-v3.rst:77
#: d602cb49e6804d28b2af48e003e9ea30
msgid "RC Input"
msgstr "RC 输入"

#: ../../source/docs/common-speedybeef4-v3.rst:79
#: 241d6b1fea4b447587753082b5bacea5
msgid ""
"RC input is configured on the R2 (UART2_RX) pin for most RC unidirectional "
"protocols except SBUS which should be applied at the SBUS pin. PPM is not "
"supported. For Fport, a bi-directional inverter will be required. See `this "
"article for connection information for F4 autopilots "
"<https://ardupilot.org/plane/docs/common-connecting-sport-fport.html>`__."
msgstr ""
"RC 输入在 R2（UART2_RX）引脚上配置，适用于大多数 RC 单向协议，但 SBUS 应接到 SBUS 引脚。不支持 PPM。FPort "
"需要双向电平转换器。有关 F4 飞控的连接信息，请参阅 `本文 <https://ardupilot.org/plane/docs/common-"
"connecting-sport-fport.html>`__。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-speedybeef4-v3.rst:81
#: dcde953964494a19ae556faf63b513a9
msgid ""
"For CRSF/ELRS/SRXL2 connection of the receiver to T2 will also be required."
msgstr "CRSF/ELRS/SRXL2 还需要将接收机连接到 T2。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-speedybeef4-v3.rst:84
#: b78ee0c6f2004bd097811b304e99a777
msgid "Dshot capability"
msgstr "DShot 能力"

#: ../../source/docs/common-speedybeef4-v3.rst:86
#: 4b3fbd84af8b48dbbabe38ea8eea6020
msgid ""
"The SpeedyBee F405 v3/v4 supports up to 9 PWM outputs. The M1 to M4 outputs "
"are on the esc connector, M5 to M8 on solder pads, plus LED pad(PWM output "
"9) for LED strip or another PWM output."
msgstr ""
"SpeedyBee F405 v3/v4 最多支持9路 PWM 输出。M1 至 M4 输出在 ESC 连接器上，M5 至 M8 在焊盘上，另有 LED "
"焊盘（PWM 输出9）用于 LED 灯带或其他 PWM 输出。"

