#: ../../source/docs/common-speedybeef4-v3.rst:106
#: e893ecaa8de449cc82f9bbaab9964260
msgid ""
"Channels within the same group need to use the same output protocol. If any "
"channel in a group uses DShot then all channels in the group need to use "
"DShot. Channels 1-4 also support bi-directional DShot (V4 only)."
msgstr ""
"同一组内的通道需使用相同的输出协议。如果某组中的任意通道使用 DShot，则该组所有通道都需要使用 DShot。通道1-4还支持双向 DShot（仅 "
"V4）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-speedybeef4-v3.rst:108
#: d1a543f65be74b55822d86777ea32838
msgid ""
"for users migrating from BetaflightX quads, the first four outputs M1-M4 "
"have been configured for use with existing motor wiring using these default "
"parameters:"
msgstr "对于从BetaflightX机架迁移的用户，前四路输出M1-M4已配置为使用现有电机接线，默认参数如下："

