#: ../../source/docs/common-speedybeef4-v3.rst:114
#: fba3986369bd4bca8dade19e1a0e98c9
msgid "OSD Support"
msgstr "OSD 支持"

#: ../../source/docs/common-speedybeef4-v3.rst:116
#: 6e56c6513037406ea68f512b26d9419c
msgid ""
"The SpeedyBee F405 v3 has an on-board OSD using :ref:`OSD_TYPE<OSD_TYPE>` ="
"  1 (MAX7456 driver). The CAM and VTX pins provide connections for using the"
" internal OSD."
msgstr ""
"SpeedyBee F405 v3 搭载板载 OSD，使用 :ref:`OSD_TYPE<OSD_TYPE>` = 1（MAX7456 驱动）。CAM "
"和 VTX 引脚提供用于使用内置 OSD 的连接。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-speedybeef4-v3.rst:119
#: b15ae4469a104b29af0a9ad0f0163ad7
msgid "DJI Video and OSD"
msgstr "DJI 视频和 OSD"

#: ../../source/docs/common-speedybeef4-v3.rst:121
#: 467d8dcc9f294eb7a2f9b53160f4aece
msgid ""
"A JST-GH-6P connector supports a standard DJI HD VTX connection and SERIAL6 "
"is already setup for this by default.  Pin 1 of the connector is 9v so be "
"careful not to connect this to any peripheral requiring 5v."
msgstr ""
"JST-GH-6P 连接器支持标准 DJI HD VTX 连接，SERIAL6 "
"已默认为此进行配置。连接器的引脚1为9V，请注意不要将其连接到任何需要5V的外设。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-speedybeef4-v3.rst:124
#: b4a1db079fa14aa1944582df39897c91
msgid "Battery Monitoring"
msgstr "电池监控"

#: ../../source/docs/common-speedybeef4-v3.rst:126
#: cbe67b8c646d4ca49cd1890c4138411e
msgid ""
"The board has a internal voltage sensor and connections on the ESC connector"
" for an external current sensor input. The voltage sensor can handle up to "
"6S LiPo batteries."
msgstr "该飞控板内置电压传感器，ESC 接头上有外部电流传感器输入接口。电压传感器支持最高 6S 锂电池。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-speedybeef4-v3.rst:128
#: 1ec4b8724d2142079bc9961de0614bb2
msgid "The default battery parameters are:"
msgstr "默认电池参数为："

#: ../../source/docs/common-speedybeef4-v3.rst:130
#: 1e0e20abf77e47f0ba022f4d89e32c43
msgid ":ref:`BATT_MONITOR<BATT_MONITOR>` = 4"
msgstr ":ref:`BATT_MONITOR<BATT_MONITOR>` = 4"

#: ../../source/docs/common-speedybeef4-v3.rst:131
#: d1c3ee6eb81d4f2698d669939f4fceed
msgid ":ref:`BATT_VOLT_PIN<BATT_VOLT_PIN__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` = 10"
msgstr ":ref:`BATT_VOLT_PIN<BATT_VOLT_PIN__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` = 10"

#: ../../source/docs/common-speedybeef4-v3.rst:132
#: f39f06ab396e49e49194b922bc8b7f74
msgid ":ref:`BATT_CURR_PIN<BATT_CURR_PIN__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` = 11"
msgstr ":ref:`BATT_CURR_PIN<BATT_CURR_PIN__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` = 11"

#: ../../source/docs/common-speedybeef4-v3.rst:133
#: fa103fce1fb34082908435dcdad4db44
msgid ":ref:`BATT_VOLT_MULT<BATT_VOLT_MULT__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` = 11.2"
msgstr ":ref:`BATT_VOLT_MULT<BATT_VOLT_MULT__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` = 11.2"

#: ../../source/docs/common-speedybeef4-v3.rst:134
#: 74c14cea2ffd477e87307c535231c2a3
msgid ""
":ref:`BATT_AMP_PERVLT<BATT_AMP_PERVLT__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` = 52.7 (will "
"need to be adjusted for whichever current sensor is attached)"
msgstr ""
":ref:`BATT_AMP_PERVLT<BATT_AMP_PERVLT__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` = "
"52.7（需根据所接电流传感器进行调整）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-speedybeef4-v3.rst:137
#: 5b30876517de4abaaed74a0efa1b1014
msgid "Compass"
msgstr "罗盘"

#: ../../source/docs/common-speedybeef4-v3.rst:139
#: ce87de0ce25f4183b863be2035faefcc
msgid ""
"The SpeedyBee F405 v3 does not have a builtin compass, but you can attach an"
" external compass using I2C on the SDA and SCL pads."
msgstr "SpeedyBee F405 v3 没有内置罗盘，但您可以通过 SDA 和 SCL 焊盘上的 I2C 连接外部罗盘。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-speedybeef4-v3.rst:142
#: ce77c6da8c1847eba7900f2752849bcb
msgid "Firmware"
msgstr "固件"

#: ../../source/docs/common-speedybeef4-v3.rst:144
#: 3a9c93ed7c534eb3833b1b85f470c837
msgid ""
"Firmware for this board can be found `here "
"<https://firmware.ardupilot.org>`_ in  sub-folders labeled \"speedybeef4v3\""
" or \"speedybeef4v4\"."
msgstr ""
"该板的固件可在 `此处 <https://firmware.ardupilot.org>`_ 的子文件夹中找到，标签为 「speedybeef4v3」 "
"或 「speedybeef4v4」。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-speedybeef4-v3.rst:147
#: 5bb35160dce8425ea56d293d00a88f57
msgid "Loading ArduPilot onto the board"
msgstr "将 ArduPilot 加载到板子上"

#: ../../source/docs/common-speedybeef4-v3.rst:149
#: 702927051760488997ed3d32d4d608b0
msgid ""
"Initial firmware load can be done with DFU by plugging in USB with the "
"bootloader button pressed. Then you should load the \"with_bl.hex\" "
"firmware, using your favourite DFU loading tool."
msgstr "初始固件加载可通过按住引导程序按钮插入USB以DFU方式完成。然后使用您喜欢的DFU加载工具加载「with_bl.hex」固件。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-speedybeef4-v3.rst:153
#: 6efc5ce4d8534917aa0dda3e0446f653
msgid ""
"Once the initial firmware is loaded you can update the firmware using any "
"ArduPilot ground station software. Updates should be done with the "
"xxxxxxxxxx.apj firmware files."
msgstr "初始固件加载完成后，可使用任意ArduPilot地面站软件更新固件。更新应使用xxxxxxxxxx.apj固件文件。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-speedybeef4-v3.rst:157
