"`SpeedyBee <https://www.speedybee.com/speedybee-f405-v3-bls-50a-30x30-fc-"
"esc-stack/>`__"
msgstr ""
"可从各零售商或直接从制造商 `SpeedyBee "
"<https://www.speedybee.com/speedybee-f405-v3-bls-50a-30x30-fc-esc-stack/>`__"
" 购买"
